<!-- ============== SECTION 6 — CANDIDATE ============== -->
<section id=" candidate ">
  <div class=" wrap ">
    <div class=" sect-head ">
      <div class=" eyebrow ">Are You a Candidate?</div>
      <h2 class=" display " style=" margin-top:14px ">
        Revive Veneers work for most people. They're not right for everyone.
      </h2>
      <p class=" sub ">
        Custom snap-on veneers enhance the appearance of healthy teeth. They aren't a replacement for permanent dental
        work, and they're not the right solution for every dental situation. Here's an honest breakdown of who Revive
        Veneers work for.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class=" cand-grid ">
      <div class=" ccard ideal ">
        <div class=" ctitle ">
          <span class=" cdot "> </span>
          Ideal candidates
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Generally healthy teeth and gums</li>
          <li>Want to improve the appearance of stained, slightly gapped, or worn teeth</li>
          <li>All upper or all lower teeth present</li>
          <li>No active gum disease or recent major dental work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class=" ccard good ">
        <div class=" ctitle ">
          <span class=" cdot "> </span>
          Good candidates, extended timeline
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Small to medium gaps in teeth</li>
          <li>Minor bite issues (slight overbite or underbite)</li>
          <li>Worn or short teeth from grinding</li>
          <li>One or two missing teeth not at the end of the arch</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" ccard consult "
      >
        <div
          class=" ctitle "
        >
          <span
            class=" cdot "
          >
          </span>
          Consult before ordering
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Active gum disease or significant gum recession</li>
          <li>Severe crossbite or bite alignment issues</li>
          <li>Recent major dental work within the last 3 months</li>
          <li>Multiple missing teeth or teeth missing at end of arch</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" ccard not "
      >
        <div
          class=" ctitle "
        >
          <span
            class=" cdot "
          >
          </span>
          Not a candidate
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>No remaining teeth in the arch you want covered</li>
          <li>Currently wearing full dentures</li>
          <li>Active oral infection or untreated periodontal disease</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class=" cand-cta-row "
    >
      <button
        class=" btn-outline "
        id=" openQuiz "
      >
        Take the 30-second Smile Assessment
        <svg
          width=" 14 "
          height=" 14 "
          viewBox=" 0 0 24 24 "
          fill=" none "
          stroke=" currentColor "
          stroke-width=" 2 "
        >
          <path
              d=" M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6 ">
              </path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p
      class=" cand-disclaimer "
    >
      Revive Veneers are cosmetic appliances, not medical devices. They enhance the appearance of your smile but do not
      treat dental conditions. Dr. Brandon Turley, DDS, recommends consulting with a licensed dentist for any underlying
      dental health concerns before ordering.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

